---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Custody — where your money actually is | Life Story Wealth Planning';
const description = 'I never hold client money. Your account is at an independent third-party custodian, in your name. I direct how it is invested. I cannot remove funds from it.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/custody">
  <main class="custody-page">
    <div class="cust-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="cust-shell">
      <header class="cust-header">
        <p class="cust-marker">
          <span class="cust-marker-dash"></span>
          <span>Chapter · Custody</span>
        </p>
        <h1 class="cust-h1">
          <span class="cust-h1-line">Where your money</span>
          <span class="cust-h1-line cust-h1-em"><em>actually is.</em></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="cust-lede">The structural safeguard behind every other thing this firm does — read straight, no adornment.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="cust-manifesto">
        <span class="cust-manifesto-mark" aria-hidden="true">§</span>
        <p class="cust-manifesto-line">I never hold client money.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cust-narrative">
        <p>
          Your account is at an independent, third-party custodian, in your own name. I direct
          how the money in it is invested. I cannot remove funds from it, to me or to anyone
          else. That distinction is the single most important structural safeguard in how I have
          set up the firm.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have ever read a story about an adviser who took client money, that story is
          almost always about an arrangement where the adviser controlled the account and could
          withdraw from it. That is not how this firm is set up, and under our agreement it
          cannot be set up that way.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="cust-mechanics" aria-labelledby="mech-h">
        <p class="cust-section-mark">How the account works</p>
        <h2 id="mech-h" class="cust-h2">Four facts, no small print.</h2>

        <ol class="cust-clauses">
          <li>
            <span class="cust-clause-num">01</span>
            <div class="cust-clause-body">
              <p class="cust-clause-h">The account is in your own name.</p>
              <p class="cust-clause-p">Not the firm's. Not a pooled fund. If you look at the paperwork, your name is on it — not mine.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="cust-clause-num">02</span>
            <div class="cust-clause-body">
              <p class="cust-clause-h">Managed separately, not pooled.</p>
              <p class="cust-clause-p">Your holdings are yours — separate from every other client's, separate from any collective vehicle.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="cust-clause-num">03</span>
            <div class="cust-clause-body">
              <p class="cust-clause-h">You see every holding and every value.</p>
              <p class="cust-clause-p">At the custodian, directly, without going through me and without asking me. It is your account.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="cust-clause-num">04</span>
            <div class="cust-clause-body">
              <p class="cust-clause-h">A third-party custodian holds the assets.</p>
              <p class="cust-clause-p">My firm does not. The line between "directing how money is invested" and "holding money" is the whole point.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <aside class="cust-plate" aria-labelledby="named-h">
        <p class="cust-plate-eyebrow">Named party · the custodian</p>
        <h3 id="named-h" class="cust-plate-name">Interactive Brokers LLC</h3>
        <p class="cust-plate-body">
          US-headquartered custodian and broker-dealer with offices around the world. Suited to
          actively managed and internationally aware portfolios. If you would prefer a different
          custodian arrangement, or if the name is unfamiliar to you, that is worth a
          conversation before we go further.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <section class="cust-verify" aria-labelledby="verify-h">
        <p class="cust-section-mark">Verifying any of this</p>
        <h2 id="verify-h" class="cust-h2">You do not have to take my word.</h2>
        <p class="cust-verify-body">
          My firm's registration and structure are public record. The Form ADV linked below
          describes the arrangement, including the custody relationship. If it matters to you
          to verify anything before we talk, that is where to look.
        </p>
        <div class="cust-verify-links">
          <a href="https://adviserinfo.sec.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cust-verify-tile">
            <span class="cust-verify-label">Form ADV</span>
            <span class="cust-verify-note">SEC / IAPD registered adviser filing</span>
            <span class="cust-verify-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://brokercheck.finra.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cust-verify-tile">
            <span class="cust-verify-label">FINRA BrokerCheck</span>
            <span class="cust-verify-note">Public record of adviser and broker history</span>
            <span class="cust-verify-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="cust-cta">
        <p class="cust-cta-line">The rest of a good conversation about custody is the conversation itself.</p>
        <a class="cta cust-cta-btn" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Page shell — full-width dark vault feel, warm cream typography */
  .custody-page {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--night, #1a1712);
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    padding: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 8rem) clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem) clamp(5rem, 8vw, 10rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);
    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);
  }
  .cust-grain {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.06), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(178, 90, 63, 0.05), transparent 45%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cust-shell {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Header — asymmetric, left-aligned marker + big H1 */
  .cust-header { margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .cust-marker {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }
  .cust-marker-dash {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .cust-h1 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.5vw, 4.4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 60;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
  }
  .cust-h1-line { display: block; }
  .cust-h1-em em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .cust-lede {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.65);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Manifesto — huge line with a section-mark hanging left */
  .cust-manifesto {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.28);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.28);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }
  .cust-manifesto-mark {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--rubric-soft, #b25a3f);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
  }
  .cust-manifesto-line {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    margin: 0;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 40;
  }

  /* Narrative — flowing body */
  .cust-narrative { margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .cust-narrative p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.3vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.88);
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .cust-narrative p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* Section marks — small brass labels above H2s */
  .cust-section-mark {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .cust-h2 {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120, 'SOFT' 40;
  }

  /* Mechanics — vertical clauses with big rubric numerals hanging left */
  .cust-mechanics { margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .cust-clauses {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .cust-clauses li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5rem) 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .cust-clause-num {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--rubric-soft, #b25a3f);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144;
  }
  .cust-clause-body { border-left: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.22); padding-left: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem); }
  .cust-clause-h {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .cust-clause-p {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.78);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Plate — the named custodian, cream card set into the dark bg */
  .cust-plate {
    background: var(--paper-2, #ece1c9);
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    position: relative;
  }
  .cust-plate-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--rubric, #8a3324);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .cust-plate-name {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--ink, #1c1712);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 120;
  }
  .cust-plate-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(28, 23, 18, 0.82);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  /* Verify — brass-bordered tiles on dark */
  .cust-verify { margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  .cust-verify-body {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.85);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .cust-verify-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
    row-gap: 0.35rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.35);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
    transition: border-color 220ms ease, background-color 220ms ease;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile:hover,
  .cust-verify-tile:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    background: rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.06);
  }
  .cust-verify-label {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--paper, #f2e6c8);
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .cust-verify-note {
    font-family: 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.6);
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
  }
  .cust-verify-arrow {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1 / -1;
    align-self: center;
    color: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    transition: transform 220ms ease;
  }
  .cust-verify-tile:hover .cust-verify-arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }

  /* CTA — brass button on dark */
  .cust-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.2);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }
  .cust-cta-line {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', 'Vollkorn', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    color: rgba(242, 230, 200, 0.72);
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 96;
  }
  .cust-cta-btn {
    background: var(--brass-soft, #c9a15a);
    color: var(--night, #1a1712);
    border: none;
  }
  .cust-cta-btn:hover,
  .cust-cta-btn:focus-visible {
    background: #d9b26a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cust-manifesto {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .cust-clauses li {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
    .cust-clause-body {
      border-left: none;
      padding-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 161, 90, 0.22);
      padding-top: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
